  "description": "The 'async8' library is a utility package designed to simplify asynchronous programming in .NET applications. It provides a comprehensive set of tools, including extension methods for Task-based operations, concurrent task management helpers, async-enabled caching, and robust retry policies. These features help developers write clean, efficient, and maintainable asynchronous code, reducing complexity while improving scalability and performance.",
